10. Frequency of Elements

def count_frequency(arr):
    for i in set(arr):
        print(i, "->", arr.count(i), "times")

arr = [1, 2, 2, 3, 1, 4, 2]
count_frequency(arr)

Output

1 -> 2 times
2 -> 3 times
3 -> 1 times
4 -> 1 times

